  "description": "SQLite provider for the Elarion EF-free tier (ADR-0058/ADR-0060), for single-node / edge NativeAOT hosts: the single AddElarionSqlite(connectionString) picks SQLite for every subsystem — it registers a DbDataSource over SqliteConnection (there is none in Microsoft.Data.Sqlite), the IElarionSqlDataSourceProvider the ISqlSession opens from, and the IMigrationDatabaseFactory the neutral AddElarionMigrations resolves. Contains the SQLite migration engine (in-process per-file lock, history table). Mirrors Elarion.Sql.PostgreSql; the neutral Elarion.Sql and Elarion.Migrations stay driver-free.",
